  "name": "concrete",
  "bpm": 134,
  "ticksPerBeat": 4,
  "length": 64,
  "loop": {
   "start": 0,
   "end": 64
  },
  "info": "Four bars of techno from five percussion machines: a kick, a hi-hat, a clap, a comb-resonator metal percussion and a tuned tom. Every pattern is only as long as the hit it holds (one or a few rows) and is placed again and again, some of them early, some late, and the sound moves through parameter cells (kick pitch envelope and decay, hat tone and decays, clap bursts and spacing, the comb resonance of the metal and the tom)."
 },
